refactor: restructure article and species APIs with shared schemas

- Replace section-based article content with a flexible block model (text, image, column)
- Move article routes from /species/:id/article to /articles/ (resource-oriented REST)
- Add GET /articles/:articleId endpoint and getById service method
- Add Zod response schemas to species and article backends; import types from backend on the frontend to eliminate duplication
- Refactor getSpeciesDetails to fetch species and article in parallel
- Replace hardcoded article rendering in SpeciesViewPage with ArticleSectionRenderer
- Fix scientific name display to combine genus + species nodes
- Update seed data to match new schema
